
## Service

- Settings come from `APP_*` environment variables (see `settings.py`);
  add each new one to `.env.example`. Never hard-code URLs or secrets.
- After changing `models.py`, add a migration with
  `uv run alembic revision --autogenerate -m "..."` and read it before
  committing; `tests/test_migrations.py` fails until you do.
- `/healthz` says the process is up; `/readyz` that it can serve. Keep both
  cheap.
